  "description": "In-process MSDF/MTSDF font-atlas generation for .NET. msdf-atlas-gen and msdfgen are compiled into a small native library with a C API, wrapped by an AOT-friendly managed API returning atlas pixels, glyph and font metrics, kerning, PNG encoding and JSON export. Native assets for win-x64, linux-x64, osx-x64, and osx-arm64, built from source in CI.",
